  <h1>HEALTHY BENEFITS OF DRINKING NITRO COFFEE, IS NITRO COFFEE HEALTHY?</h1>
  <p>People ask: is nitro cold brew bad for you, and what are the benefits of nitro coffee? This page describes the health context of coffee and of nitro coffee.</p>

  <h2>Coffee, caffeine and antioxidants</h2>
  <p>Coffee contains caffeine and antioxidants.</p>

  <h2>Black, sugar-free and dairy-free</h2>
  <p>Nitro coffee is served black, so it has no sugar and no dairy. Its creamy texture comes from nitrogen, not from cream or sweeteners.</p>

  <h2>Nitrogen is an inert gas</h2>
  <p>Nitrogen is an inert gas that makes up most of the air around us. It is used to serve nitro coffee.</p>

  <h2>Convenient to drink cold</h2>
  <p>Nitro coffee is smooth and served cold, so it is convenient to drink straight from the tap.</p>

  <p>This page is general information, not medical advice. Learn <a href="/nitro-cold-brew/">all about nitro cold brew coffee</a> or see <a href="/products/">our products</a>.</p>
